# Singular – end-to-end attribution and analytics platform

> Singular is a next-generation marketing analytics and attribution platform designed to power faster growth through smarter ROI insights. We unify attribution, cost aggregation, fraud prevention, ad monetization, and cross-platform analytics into one source of truth—enabling marketing teams to optimize performance, reduce manual work, and scale efficiently.

Used by leading mobile-first and enterprise brands, Singular provides actionable insights with automated data pipelines, privacy-ready SKAN reporting, and the industry’s top fraud protection.

> Explore solutions for marketing analytics, cost aggregation, ETL, mobile attribution, fraud prevention, and ad monetization. Access customer success stories, technical documentation, educational content on MMPs, SKAN, and deep linking, and thought leadership via the Singular Blog. The platform is trusted by growth teams to save time, align internal stakeholders, and drive high-performance user acquisition


